{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22474","headline":"徵秋税毕题郡南亭 · 白居易","name":"徵秋税毕题郡南亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高城直下视，蠢蠢见巴蛮。\n安可施政教，尚不通语言。\n且喜赋敛毕，幸闻闾井安。\n岂伊循良化，赖此丰登年。\n案牍既简少，池馆亦清闲。\n秋雨檐果落，夕钟林鸟还。\n南亭日潇洒，偃卧恣疎顽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}